(362136, 29618, 9669, '<td valign="top">As I have said to two other people, This is an example of a great photograph which may get an average score.  If this happens, don''t worry.  You should be judging the mass of voters as much as they are judging you on this one.  Great photographs are rarely appreciated on this site.  Although it does feel out of focus.  8</td>', 'As I have said to two other people, This is an example of a great photograph which may get an average score.  If this happens, don''t worry.  You should be judging the mass of voters as much as they are judging you on this one.  Great photographs are rarely appreciated on this site.  Although it does feel out of focus.  8', '2003-07-21 08:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
