(362219, 29482, 6999, '<td valign="top">Those petals that are just closer than the field of focus are unfortunately the ones right on the thirds line, which is what I think makes them stand out for me. The vase is perhaps under-lit compared to the flower also, especially inside the neck, and that reduces the visibility of the contrast - in fact the vase appears almost as a background element it''s so much darker.</td>', 'Those petals that are just closer than the field of focus are unfortunately the ones right on the thirds line, which is what I think makes them stand out for me. The vase is perhaps under-lit compared to the flower also, especially inside the neck, and that reduces the visibility of the contrast - in fact the vase appears almost as a background element it''s so much darker.', '2003-07-21 10:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(362220, 29745, 7763, '<td valign="top">Those dang Oreos are so photogenic, but now i''m so hungry!!!!!!! Pass the milk, please????</td>', 'Those dang Oreos are so photogenic, but now i''m so hungry!!!!!!! Pass the milk, please????', '2003-07-21 10:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
