(362225, 29326, 6999, '<td valign="top">Lighting! This is flash, yes? if it weren''t for the faint reflections of the white pieces in the black one I doubt it would be visible at all. even a couple of table lamps will provide enough light for digital cameras, position them to the sides of the subject and turn off that flash and compare the outcome.</td>', 'Lighting! This is flash, yes? if it weren''t for the faint reflections of the white pieces in the black one I doubt it would be visible at all. even a couple of table lamps will provide enough light for digital cameras, position them to the sides of the subject and turn off that flash and compare the outcome.', '2003-07-21 10:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
