(362457, 29776, 3102, '<td valign="top">Good eye!  A well thought out way of meeting the challenge!  And B&amp;W seems like a good choice for the mood, too.</td>', 'Good eye!  A well thought out way of meeting the challenge!  And B&W seems like a good choice for the mood, too.', '2003-07-21 13:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(362459, 29701, 327, '<td valign="top">Great title....Great composition...........wow. Fantastic shot.</td>', 'Great title....Great composition...........wow. Fantastic shot.', '2003-07-21 13:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(362460, 29599, 3102, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done!  I had thought of something similar, but you pulled it off in a very good way.  - 9</td>', 'Beautifully done!  I had thought of something similar, but you pulled it off in a very good way.  - 9', '2003-07-21 13:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(362463, 29768, 327, '<td valign="top">Good shot..love the simplicity.</td>', 'Good shot..love the simplicity.', '2003-07-21 13:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(362468, 29761, 6661, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast here as well as the texture on the fabric. The perspective work really well too. Great Job!</td>', 'I love the contrast here as well as the texture on the fabric. The perspective work really well too. Great Job!', '2003-07-21 13:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(362487, 29647, 2223, '<td valign="top">great capture and contrast.</td>', 'great capture and contrast.', '2003-07-21 14:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(362488, 29163, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is stunning... and is perfect for the challenge.  Very interesting what you did here, and incredible job on the lighting!  Some great leading lines... -9-</td>', 'This is stunning... and is perfect for the challenge.  Very interesting what you did here, and incredible job on the lighting!  Some great leading lines... -9-', '2003-07-21 14:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(362491, 29728, 4967, '<td valign="top">Hehehe... interesting... I''m wondering how you got the scale to stick at 100.  Nice job though!  The lighting isn''t very interesting here, but I think it gets the point across. Bothered a little by the lighting around the metal ring, but not too badly.  Definitely fits the challenge, although I don''t find it to be very appealing photo wise.</td>', 'Hehehe... interesting... I''m wondering how you got the scale to stick at 100.  Nice job though!  The lighting isn''t very interesting here, but I think it gets the point across. Bothered a little by the lighting around the metal ring, but not too badly.  Definitely fits the challenge, although I don''t find it to be very appealing photo wise.', '2003-07-21 14:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(362493, 29686, 2223, '<td valign="top">cute bug and good shot, but not very contrasty.</td>', 'cute bug and good shot, but not very contrasty.', '2003-07-21 14:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(362496, 29094, 4967, '<td valign="top">Hehehe... this is cute... I like how the car is slightly blurred so that you know it is in motion.  That painitng is awesome!  The bricks on the wall, and the fact that the road is brick also is really nice.  I like how the car is going out of the frame, and really seems as though the horse is chasing it.  I see what you were going for in contrast here.</td>', 'Hehehe... this is cute... I like how the car is slightly blurred so that you know it is in motion.  That painitng is awesome!  The bricks on the wall, and the fact that the road is brick also is really nice.  I like how the car is going out of the frame, and really seems as though the horse is chasing it.  I see what you were going for in contrast here.', '2003-07-21 14:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(362504, 29387, 4967, '<td valign="top">Not sure where your contrast comes into play here.  I like the softness of the photo though... and the background is awesome!</td>', 'Not sure where your contrast comes into play here.  I like the softness of the photo though... and the background is awesome!', '2003-07-21 14:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(362508, 28772, 3102, '<td valign="top">You might have juiced the saturation of the reds a little better to make the Jack stand out a little more, but it''s a great crisp image, and a nice concept.</td>', 'You might have juiced the saturation of the reds a little better to make the Jack stand out a little more, but it''s a great crisp image, and a nice concept.', '2003-07-21 14:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(362510, 29550, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m not entirely sure where the "contrast" is in this image... would have been a winner with a guy in a devil outfit walking past... :)</td>', 'I''m not entirely sure where the "contrast" is in this image... would have been a winner with a guy in a devil outfit walking past... :)', '2003-07-21 14:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(362514, 29701, 2223, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot! Great contrast and i love the border and the title.</td>', 'Awesome shot! Great contrast and i love the border and the title.', '2003-07-21 14:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(362519, 29657, 2223, '<td valign="top">Very pretty!</td>', 'Very pretty!', '2003-07-21 14:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(362521, 29769, 10446, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  A different backdrop would have done wonders.</td>', 'Very nice.  A different backdrop would have done wonders.', '2003-07-21 14:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(362523, 29744, 2223, '<td valign="top">WOW!! what a sky!! Great capture!!</td>', 'WOW!! what a sky!! Great capture!!', '2003-07-21 14:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(362535, 29746, 4482, '<td valign="top">Would this be a SONIFO shot??? :o) Great one!</td>', 'Would this be a SONIFO shot??? :o) Great one!', '2003-07-21 15:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(362540, 29723, 772, '<td valign="top">I think this is in very poor taste.  Now that i''m over the ''poor taste'' factor involved in this photo, I should probably discuss the photograph itself...   Compositionally, it''s fine.. the only element of the composition that I don''t care for is the feeling that the bear is floating is space with no visible surface... Technically, I don''t like the yellow tungsten glow on this one... i don''t know if that was intentional or not, but it can easily be corrected or shifted with white balance adjustents in cam or with software in post processing...</td>', 'I think this is in very poor taste.  Now that i''m over the ''poor taste'' factor involved in this photo, I should probably discuss the photograph itself...   Compositionally, it''s fine.. the only element of the composition that I don''t care for is the feeling that the bear is floating is space with no visible surface... Technically, I don''t like the yellow tungsten glow on this one... i don''t know if that was intentional or not, but it can easily be corrected or shifted with white balance adjustents in cam or with software in post processing...', '2003-07-21 15:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(362543, 29686, 6624, '<td valign="top">I love it but it''s not contrasty enough for me to go all thye way</td>', 'I love it but it''s not contrasty enough for me to go all thye way', '2003-07-21 15:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(362544, 29775, 472, '<td valign="top">this hits the challenge dead on!  i love the empty white space, and the lightness towards the upper right part of the feather seems to imply that it''s lifting into the air. brilliant!</td>', 'this hits the challenge dead on!  i love the empty white space, and the lightness towards the upper right part of the feather seems to imply that it''s lifting into the air. brilliant!', '2003-07-21 15:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(362551, 29727, 1717, '<td valign="top">i love this!  lighting, crop, symmetry...all perfect!  contrast all over the place...the colors, the composition.  another contrast is the difference in taste of the peppers...a contrast that is harder to get across through a photo, but one that you''ve managed quite well.  excellent work!....10</td>', 'i love this!  lighting, crop, symmetry...all perfect!  contrast all over the place...the colors, the composition.  another contrast is the difference in taste of the peppers...a contrast that is harder to get across through a photo, but one that you''ve managed quite well.  excellent work!....10', '2003-07-21 15:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(362605, 29329, 6651, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite photo, for contrast in both color and symbol!</td>', 'This is my favorite photo, for contrast in both color and symbol!', '2003-07-21 17:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(362624, 29723, 7966, '<td valign="top">interesting to say the least. The photo is kinda yellow, I don''t know if that was the lighting or if it was intentional or not. I would have liked to see truer colors. Maybe if you had something other than the black background it would have given it a better feel, like have it set up on a childs blanket or quilt or on a bed or in a crib or something.</td>', 'interesting to say the least. The photo is kinda yellow, I don''t know if that was the lighting or if it was intentional or not. I would have liked to see truer colors. Maybe if you had something other than the black background it would have given it a better feel, like have it set up on a childs blanket or quilt or on a bed or in a crib or something.', '2003-07-21 17:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(362628, 29335, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice bonsai! Grow them myself. The bleached background adds much to the shot without actually overexposing the main subject. It''s a striking image, although I would perhaps have cropped out the pot since the illusion of a normal sized tree is slightly lost. [7]</td>', 'Nice bonsai! Grow them myself. The bleached background adds much to the shot without actually overexposing the main subject. It''s a striking image, although I would perhaps have cropped out the pot since the illusion of a normal sized tree is slightly lost. [7]', '2003-07-21 17:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(362629, 29734, 7966, '<td valign="top">very cool. kinda wish that shadow wasn''t there though, it takes away from the main focus. great shot though</td>', 'very cool. kinda wish that shadow wasn''t there though, it takes away from the main focus. great shot though', '2003-07-21 17:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(362630, 29616, 7966, '<td valign="top">nice angle but it''s not totally in focus</td>', 'nice angle but it''s not totally in focus', '2003-07-21 17:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(362635, 29765, 7966, '<td valign="top">wow! this one definatly got my attention in the thumbnail gallery! that is a great shot, it looks like you were really close. (I would have crapped myself!) i would have cropped a little off the right side though</td>', 'wow! this one definatly got my attention in the thumbnail gallery! that is a great shot, it looks like you were really close. (I would have crapped myself!) i would have cropped a little off the right side though', '2003-07-21 17:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(362636, 29299, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful shot. Lovely tonal range. [7]</td>', 'Very beautiful shot. Lovely tonal range. [7]', '2003-07-21 17:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(362639, 29605, 7966, '<td valign="top">that''s a very interesting shot. i love the perspective and it''s crisp and clear. great job</td>', 'that''s a very interesting shot. i love the perspective and it''s crisp and clear. great job', '2003-07-21 17:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(362680, 29415, 3469, '<td valign="top">Good idea, I would have liked to see the man closer up in the picture (is this posed or a candid snapshot?) The concrete horizontal strip is not adding to the picture (more of the trees above might have done better). You should have come up with a better title than this one.</td>', 'Good idea, I would have liked to see the man closer up in the picture (is this posed or a candid snapshot?) The concrete horizontal strip is not adding to the picture (more of the trees above might have done better). You should have come up with a better title than this one.', '2003-07-21 18:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(362685, 29605, 4967, '<td valign="top">in focus/ out of focus and veryn nicely done... I''m guessing somone was holding the very edge of the dart? hence the reason you had to crop there... I like this photo a lot.  I would have liked all of the dart in focus but that probably wasn''t possible.</td>', 'in focus/ out of focus and veryn nicely done... I''m guessing somone was holding the very edge of the dart? hence the reason you had to crop there... I like this photo a lot.  I would have liked all of the dart in focus but that probably wasn''t possible.', '2003-07-21 18:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(362691, 29769, 4967, '<td valign="top">Good idea for contrast however this isn''t a very appealing photo.  The lighting is very flat, and the shadow especially from the man''s hand is rathher annoying.  A solid background might have been nice... as well as having the man''s thumb in the photo.  Black and white might have been nice for this.</td>', 'Good idea for contrast however this isn''t a very appealing photo.  The lighting is very flat, and the shadow especially from the man''s hand is rathher annoying.  A solid background might have been nice... as well as having the man''s thumb in the photo.  Black and white might have been nice for this.', '2003-07-21 18:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(362769, 29599, 7969, '<td valign="top">For a simple shot of two hands it wonderfully conveys a feeling  (and a contrast).  It is a moving shot, the title helps to convey the generations between them.  The photo really causes me to think about all the stories these hands have to tell.  Great job.</td>', 'For a simple shot of two hands it wonderfully conveys a feeling  (and a contrast).  It is a moving shot, the title helps to convey the generations between them.  The photo really causes me to think about all the stories these hands have to tell.  Great job.', '2003-07-21 19:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(362777, 29647, 7969, '<td valign="top">Well, i am not completely sure what the contrast is per se(except b&amp;w which was not how i understood the challenge but) , I can ''t argue with the fact the this is a fabulous capture.  It is clear  your timing was perfect.  I love the lower hand as it is still reaching, and the positioning of the legs.  If I had a real request it would be to have seen more of his face, though I suspect the lighting impeded it?  just a thought,  very nice shot  congrats</td>', 'Well, i am not completely sure what the contrast is per se(except b&w which was not how i understood the challenge but) , I can ''t argue with the fact the this is a fabulous capture.  It is clear  your timing was perfect.  I love the lower hand as it is still reaching, and the positioning of the legs.  If I had a real request it would be to have seen more of his face, though I suspect the lighting impeded it?  just a thought,  very nice shot  congrats', '2003-07-21 19:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(362779, 29544, 7969, '<td valign="top">I will be curious as to how your shot does in the end,  I really like it,  I like the curves at the edges of the wood.  The colors are incredibly rich and I like the way you have composed it.  The lighting feels warm.  Curious what the spotting is on the top right in black area? Is that in the post processing?  great shot</td>', 'I will be curious as to how your shot does in the end,  I really like it,  I like the curves at the edges of the wood.  The colors are incredibly rich and I like the way you have composed it.  The lighting feels warm.  Curious what the spotting is on the top right in black area? Is that in the post processing?  great shot', '2003-07-21 20:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(362782, 29749, 7969, '<td valign="top">While this shot obviously has a lot of post processing, I think it is well done.  The intense lighting from the bottom contrasted with dark top is a neat effect.  Not sure about the x''s is it x as in x-rated or x-ray or ....?  Overall I figure it adds an artsy-ness to it.  well done</td>', 'While this shot obviously has a lot of post processing, I think it is well done.  The intense lighting from the bottom contrasted with dark top is a neat effect.  Not sure about the x''s is it x as in x-rated or x-ray or ....?  Overall I figure it adds an artsy-ness to it.  well done', '2003-07-21 20:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(362784, 29616, 7969, '<td valign="top">The two things that ''get'' me about this shot is the emptiness in it, I think it is great, and I love the black and white tones in contrast to the color people.  The lines too are clear, simple and add to the perspective.  All around really nice.  very nice.</td>', 'The two things that ''get'' me about this shot is the emptiness in it, I think it is great, and I love the black and white tones in contrast to the color people.  The lines too are clear, simple and add to the perspective.  All around really nice.  very nice.', '2003-07-21 20:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(362788, 29689, 7969, '<td valign="top">The softness and gentleness your shot convey is a testimony IMO to your skill at lighting, really its a dying/dead leaf  (i think),  yet you have made it a thing of wonder, what an amazing  job.  It looks fragile and weathered, yet life seems to still be fitting in it.  Quite curious how you got the lighting this way.  Is it a lightbulb behind some kind of paper helping to soften it?  simply lovely IMO</td>', 'The softness and gentleness your shot convey is a testimony IMO to your skill at lighting, really its a dying/dead leaf  (i think),  yet you have made it a thing of wonder, what an amazing  job.  It looks fragile and weathered, yet life seems to still be fitting in it.  Quite curious how you got the lighting this way.  Is it a lightbulb behind some kind of paper helping to soften it?  simply lovely IMO', '2003-07-21 20:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(362796, 29108, 7969, '<td valign="top">Hmm for me this shot is really made by the silhouetted tree on the left, the contrast coming in from the lamposts, and while it works for this challenge, sure ruins the landscape eh?  <br/>I like this shot the emptiness of it.  Nice cloud too.</td>', 'Hmm for me this shot is really made by the silhouetted tree on the left, the contrast coming in from the lamposts, and while it works for this challenge, sure ruins the landscape eh?  I like this shot the emptiness of it.  Nice cloud too.', '2003-07-21 20:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(362799, 29644, 7969, '<td valign="top">I think you got me,  at first I was sure this was a statue on second look of course it is not.  The hair is good, and you caught a good expression on him, his eys are frozen yet alert, (good mime) Would have like to have seen slightly more light on his face, but generally a good capture.</td>', 'I think you got me,  at first I was sure this was a statue on second look of course it is not.  The hair is good, and you caught a good expression on him, his eys are frozen yet alert, (good mime) Would have like to have seen slightly more light on his face, but generally a good capture.', '2003-07-21 20:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(362802, 29673, 7969, '<td valign="top">I tend to be biased towards animal shots, I love them.  But I think this one is particularly interesting beacause of the stripes.  He also looks like he is sitting almost upright and leaning against the back of the chair.  I do wish there was a light stripe over his eye so it was more visiible and could get more sense of his personality.  I think the ear sticking up is great and the fact the he stayed still long enough to set up light and shot is testament either to his obedience or your skill as photographer--  i ll let you decide which  :  )<br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/></td>', 'I tend to be biased towards animal shots, I love them.  But I think this one is particularly interesting beacause of the stripes.  He also looks like he is sitting almost upright and leaning against the back of the chair.  I do wish there was a light stripe over his eye so it was more visiible and could get more sense of his personality.  I think the ear sticking up is great and the fact the he stayed still long enough to set up light and shot is testament either to his obedience or your skill as photographer--  i ll let you decide which  :  )          ', '2003-07-21 20:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(362812, 29415, 7969, '<td valign="top">Well, you''ve probably captured one of the biggest contrasts ''life'' has to offer.   I really like the distance of the man to the tombstones, And while I wish he were a little closer so I could see expression a bit more, he looks hesitant to me, as if death were perhaps contagious so not wanting to get too close.  I think you have also done well to capture the pensive and reflectiveness one experiences while at a grave.   nice work.</td>', 'Well, you''ve probably captured one of the biggest contrasts ''life'' has to offer.   I really like the distance of the man to the tombstones, And while I wish he were a little closer so I could see expression a bit more, he looks hesitant to me, as if death were perhaps contagious so not wanting to get too close.  I think you have also done well to capture the pensive and reflectiveness one experiences while at a grave.   nice work.', '2003-07-21 20:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(362816, 29657, 7969, '<td valign="top">For me what makes your sunset it the way it is framed between the two rock pillars, there foreboding strength in the foreground giving way to the gentleness of the warm sunset colors.  <br/>Makes me think it is a good analogy for life and nature, has both a harsh and soft side.  good eye to capture it.</td>', 'For me what makes your sunset it the way it is framed between the two rock pillars, there foreboding strength in the foreground giving way to the gentleness of the warm sunset colors.  Makes me think it is a good analogy for life and nature, has both a harsh and soft side.  good eye to capture it.', '2003-07-21 20:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
