(363088, 29389, 4494, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is truely awesome.  Great shot I luuuuuuuuuuuuuv it. :)  Did you dodge and burn this. ;)  JK, great shot.  9.</td>', 'Wow, this is truely awesome.  Great shot I luuuuuuuuuuuuuv it. :)  Did you dodge and burn this. ;)  JK, great shot.  9.', '2003-07-22 00:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
