(363091, 29665, 8637, '<td valign="top">Extraordinarily beautiful capture of common flower...great shot.  thanks</td>', 'Extraordinarily beautiful capture of common flower...great shot.  thanks', '2003-07-22 00:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(363092, 29726, 4494, '<td valign="top">Nice layout, lighting, subjects.... great.  It looks like an ad almost.  Very well done.</td>', 'Nice layout, lighting, subjects.... great.  It looks like an ad almost.  Very well done.', '2003-07-22 00:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(363094, 28772, 4494, '<td valign="top">Should have definately made the Jack level with the horizon.  That would give it more "power" I think.  And also use other cards beside the Aces.  In my mind, the Aces compete with the Jack.  Use 3''s, 5''s, 4''s, etc.  Good shot anway.</td>', 'Should have definately made the Jack level with the horizon.  That would give it more "power" I think.  And also use other cards beside the Aces.  In my mind, the Aces compete with the Jack.  Use 3''s, 5''s, 4''s, etc.  Good shot anway.', '2003-07-22 00:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(363095, 29165, 4494, '<td valign="top">Awesome.  Please tell use after the challenge, how you did this. :)</td>', 'Awesome.  Please tell use after the challenge, how you did this. :)', '2003-07-22 00:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(363096, 29743, 4494, '<td valign="top">Cute shot.  Maybe a little too much red in the shot, but I think you may have done this to match her hair?  Good job!</td>', 'Cute shot.  Maybe a little too much red in the shot, but I think you may have done this to match her hair?  Good job!', '2003-07-22 00:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(363097, 29749, 4494, '<td valign="top">Freaky... I like it. :)   If you could get rid of the light blue pixelated effects on the arms, due to tweaking the image, it would really be great.  Maybe try using neat image on this and do an "outtake" post of it after the challeng?!  Like to see the results.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Freaky... I like it. :)   If you could get rid of the light blue pixelated effects on the arms, due to tweaking the image, it would really be great.  Maybe try using neat image on this and do an "outtake" post of it after the challeng?!  Like to see the results. ', '2003-07-22 00:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(363098, 29736, 4494, '<td valign="top">Really nice.  Perfect blend of white and black.  8.</td>', 'Really nice.  Perfect blend of white and black.  8.', '2003-07-22 00:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(363099, 29711, 4494, '<td valign="top">Ack, you over did it.   The whites are blown out too much.</td>', 'Ack, you over did it.   The whites are blown out too much.', '2003-07-22 00:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(363100, 29615, 4494, '<td valign="top">Another great "outtake"/remake of the one-lens pair of glasses.  Great job.</td>', 'Another great "outtake"/remake of the one-lens pair of glasses.  Great job.', '2003-07-22 00:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(363101, 29335, 4494, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see more black midtones in the tree.</td>', 'I''d like to see more black midtones in the tree.', '2003-07-22 01:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(363103, 29637, 4494, '<td valign="top">Would be better flipped 90 degrees to the right maybe.  Very cool anyway, good job.</td>', 'Would be better flipped 90 degrees to the right maybe.  Very cool anyway, good job.', '2003-07-22 01:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(363105, 29744, 4494, '<td valign="top">Wooooooooooooowwww!   That is absolutely spectacular!!!!  I''ve never seen anything like this, truely awesome.  8.   You should save this shot and use that background for "artistic" shots (as a background layer, etc) if you are in to that.  You could flip it and use the clouds as a red sea with a ship sailing through it, etc. :)</td>', 'Wooooooooooooowwww!   That is absolutely spectacular!!!!  I''ve never seen anything like this, truely awesome.  8.   You should save this shot and use that background for "artistic" shots (as a background layer, etc) if you are in to that.  You could flip it and use the clouds as a red sea with a ship sailing through it, etc. :)', '2003-07-22 01:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(363110, 29582, 4494, '<td valign="top">This is so cool I absolutely LOVE IT and love the colors and simple subject!  You should sell prints of this.  Great job!  9.</td>', 'This is so cool I absolutely LOVE IT and love the colors and simple subject!  You should sell prints of this.  Great job!  9.', '2003-07-22 01:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
