(363114, 29559, 4494, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  Again (like the other challenge), I love the 3 pure black, grey, and white water with little other shades in between.  Very nice!</td>', 'Excellent.  Again (like the other challenge), I love the 3 pure black, grey, and white water with little other shades in between.  Very nice!', '2003-07-22 01:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
