(363117, 29305, 4494, '<td valign="top">I gotta get a pool table. :)  This shot maybe needs a blast of light to give highlights on the balls and cue sticks.</td>', 'I gotta get a pool table. :)  This shot maybe needs a blast of light to give highlights on the balls and cue sticks.', '2003-07-22 01:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(363120, 29483, 4494, '<td valign="top">Too bad those grass blades are there.  Otherwise nice.</td>', 'Too bad those grass blades are there.  Otherwise nice.', '2003-07-22 01:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(363121, 29723, 4494, '<td valign="top">LOL, a dildo is your idea of women-hood?  We ARE in trouble today I think. :D :D<br/></td>', 'LOL, a dildo is your idea of women-hood?  We ARE in trouble today I think. :D :D', '2003-07-22 01:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(363128, 29775, 4494, '<td valign="top">2 contrasts in one shot, good job.</td>', '2 contrasts in one shot, good job.', '2003-07-22 01:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(363129, 29729, 9679, '<td valign="top">Interesting interpretation. Chocolate sauce on a cracker? Sweet vs. salty as well as wet and dry? A different angle or placement within the frame might have added even more to the effect, although I do like the crisp edge of the cracker and the look of the chocolate.</td>', 'Interesting interpretation. Chocolate sauce on a cracker? Sweet vs. salty as well as wet and dry? A different angle or placement within the frame might have added even more to the effect, although I do like the crisp edge of the cracker and the look of the chocolate.', '2003-07-22 01:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(363130, 29651, 9679, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, warm tones. I wish I could see just a bit more of the cello in this.</td>', 'Beautiful, warm tones. I wish I could see just a bit more of the cello in this.', '2003-07-22 01:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(363131, 29603, 9679, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and sense of light versus dark. Could perhaps be a little sharper for my tastes.</td>', 'Lovely colors and sense of light versus dark. Could perhaps be a little sharper for my tastes.', '2003-07-22 01:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(363132, 29580, 4494, '<td valign="top">Hey, you "stole" my rain gutter idea. :D :D  See one of my Portfollio (Symetry challenge I think). :)</td>', 'Hey, you "stole" my rain gutter idea. :D :D  See one of my Portfollio (Symetry challenge I think). :)', '2003-07-22 01:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(363135, 29749, 9679, '<td valign="top">Great effect. I think I would have liked it even more without the large white area under her arm. The black and blue work well together for me.</td>', 'Great effect. I think I would have liked it even more without the large white area under her arm. The black and blue work well together for me.', '2003-07-22 01:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(363136, 29015, 9679, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful. Great detail in the stained glass. 9</td>', 'Simply beautiful. Great detail in the stained glass. 9', '2003-07-22 01:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(363137, 28890, 9679, '<td valign="top">Wow. Very dynamic!  I wonder how long the model had to hold this pose.? 9</td>', 'Wow. Very dynamic!  I wonder how long the model had to hold this pose.? 9', '2003-07-22 01:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(363138, 29701, 4494, '<td valign="top">This is very cool.  I think it may be my favorite out of all them so far!  The only thing that bothers me is the unrealistic shadow on the women in the foreground.  Wonder what caused that.  9.</td>', 'This is very cool.  I think it may be my favorite out of all them so far!  The only thing that bothers me is the unrealistic shadow on the women in the foreground.  Wonder what caused that.  9.', '2003-07-22 01:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
