(363247, 29580, 5728, '<td valign="top">It is contrasty for sure, I guess it is a fence or something? It is a little blurry, I''m not sure if you meant it that way or not.</td>', 'It is contrasty for sure, I guess it is a fence or something? It is a little blurry, I''m not sure if you meant it that way or not.', '2003-07-22 07:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
