(363831, 29288, 1202, '<td valign="top">A beautiful picture, but I think the knives are less of a contrast than you planned.   They are harmonious with the hides in my estimation, and the bronzish cast even ties them in more.   7</td>', 'A beautiful picture, but I think the knives are less of a contrast than you planned.   They are harmonious with the hides in my estimation, and the bronzish cast even ties them in more.   7', '2003-07-22 20:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
