(363840, 29711, 1202, '<td valign="top">I know cows and manure go together but I think I would have worked around it this time.  The cow''s shoulders are quite a bit on the bright side losing most of their detail.  I like the way you have the cows head right up into your picture though.   5</td>', 'I know cows and manure go together but I think I would have worked around it this time.  The cow''s shoulders are quite a bit on the bright side losing most of their detail.  I like the way you have the cows head right up into your picture though.   5', '2003-07-22 20:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(363843, 29675, 1202, '<td valign="top">Nice angle.  <br/>The shape of the steeple ties the church in with the skyscraper rather well. The lens flare is distractin from an otherwise nice great shot.  6</td>', 'Nice angle.  The shape of the steeple ties the church in with the skyscraper rather well. The lens flare is distractin from an otherwise nice great shot.  6', '2003-07-22 20:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(363861, 29493, 10263, '<td valign="top">I''m a beginner so I can''t offer any good advice on your picture but just wanted to say that the idea is wonderful. The double contrast.. between light and dark and between prey and pray is very creative :)</td>', 'I''m a beginner so I can''t offer any good advice on your picture but just wanted to say that the idea is wonderful. The double contrast.. between light and dark and between prey and pray is very creative :)', '2003-07-22 21:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(363899, 29767, 1202, '<td valign="top">Your light source seems to be quite harsh, and could be toned down quite a bit.  All of those specks distract from the main subject.   If they are lint or dust cleanliness can''t be stressed enough.   If your baclground is farther back from the subject some of the spots will go away.   Experiment with less light and longer exposures.  4</td>', 'Your light source seems to be quite harsh, and could be toned down quite a bit.  All of those specks distract from the main subject.   If they are lint or dust cleanliness can''t be stressed enough.   If your baclground is farther back from the subject some of the spots will go away.   Experiment with less light and longer exposures.  4', '2003-07-22 22:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(363906, 29544, 1202, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Looks like a broken cue stick.  7</td>', 'Nice shot.  Looks like a broken cue stick.  7', '2003-07-22 22:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(363911, 29686, 1202, '<td valign="top">Great macro but it reminds me more of camoflage than contrast.  7</td>', 'Great macro but it reminds me more of camoflage than contrast.  7', '2003-07-22 22:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
