(363975, 29567, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good contrasting subjects. The image is hard to see because everything runs together - ironically, I think it could use more ocntrast.</td>', 'Good contrasting subjects. The image is hard to see because everything runs together - ironically, I think it could use more ocntrast.', '2003-07-22 23:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(363980, 29701, 6325, '<td valign="top">Well done. Maintained detail in dark and light areas and also achieved good contrast. The composition is very intriguing.</td>', 'Well done. Maintained detail in dark and light areas and also achieved good contrast. The composition is very intriguing.', '2003-07-23 00:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(363985, 29559, 6325, '<td valign="top">I like the image. The composition is very nice - structured, but not too symmetric. The tone control is excellent - deep blacks and bright whites and smooth grays. Challenge-wise, I think the 8 - 10 numbers are very strong, but he 11 and 12 detract from the theme. OK, ignore that, they actually make my eye pop to the high contast area. 10 from me.</td>', 'I like the image. The composition is very nice - structured, but not too symmetric. The tone control is excellent - deep blacks and bright whites and smooth grays. Challenge-wise, I think the 8 - 10 numbers are very strong, but he 11 and 12 detract from the theme. OK, ignore that, they actually make my eye pop to the high contast area. 10 from me.', '2003-07-23 00:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(363994, 29165, 7969, '<td valign="top">I think what works for me in your photo is that the colors of the feathers and of your background are pretty much the same shades, produces a monotone feel (even though i see it is not one color : ) )  The similarities in color also help the feathers look like they are floating which gives it a light airy feel, hence supporting your title nicely, nice shot.</td>', 'I think what works for me in your photo is that the colors of the feathers and of your background are pretty much the same shades, produces a monotone feel (even though i see it is not one color : ) )  The similarities in color also help the feathers look like they are floating which gives it a light airy feel, hence supporting your title nicely, nice shot.', '2003-07-23 00:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(363997, 29567, 7969, '<td valign="top">I like your contrasts in subject suits challenge well, my only criticism would be the lighting in front of truck is too bright.  A mid-day shot I suspect.</td>', 'I like your contrasts in subject suits challenge well, my only criticism would be the lighting in front of truck is too bright.  A mid-day shot I suspect.', '2003-07-23 00:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(364001, 29631, 7969, '<td valign="top">The pool of water is a great point of interest IMO.  I like your idea with the circles on the bottom but find it a little ''too white'', perhaps a slight shade darker?  But what do I know.</td>', 'The pool of water is a great point of interest IMO.  I like your idea with the circles on the bottom but find it a little ''too white'', perhaps a slight shade darker?  But what do I know.', '2003-07-23 00:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(364005, 29743, 7969, '<td valign="top">If this were my child I would pay money for this shot.  The light in her eye, the natural smile, wonderful freckles, great tones in the shot.  An excellent capture IMO.  Also blurred background very well.  Not completely sure about the contrast, I am assuming the colors, works for me.  good work  : )   <br/></td>', 'If this were my child I would pay money for this shot.  The light in her eye, the natural smile, wonderful freckles, great tones in the shot.  An excellent capture IMO.  Also blurred background very well.  Not completely sure about the contrast, I am assuming the colors, works for me.  good work  : )   ', '2003-07-23 00:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(364011, 29493, 7969, '<td valign="top">Great contrasts,  in colors and  in themes. I like the stark bird and tombstone against the billowing and imposing clouds.  This shot could easily be in a horror film to add ambience.  Really nice work</td>', 'Great contrasts,  in colors and  in themes. I like the stark bird and tombstone against the billowing and imposing clouds.  This shot could easily be in a horror film to add ambience.  Really nice work', '2003-07-23 00:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(364017, 29765, 7969, '<td valign="top">Good timing and nerves of steal to capture this shot.  (I tend to hide under my bed or at least covers when thunder and lightening occur :  )  ).   Good contrast between the lightening and the dark house.  Just curious about the blueish line over the house, is that another lightening strike or a reflection in camera.</td>', 'Good timing and nerves of steal to capture this shot.  (I tend to hide under my bed or at least covers when thunder and lightening occur :  )  ).   Good contrast between the lightening and the dark house.  Just curious about the blueish line over the house, is that another lightening strike or a reflection in camera.', '2003-07-23 00:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(364018, 29701, 7969, '<td valign="top">The compostion of the clusters of people in the sort of ''empty'' water is what I like, interesting too the water is white, nice shades and tones and still did not have any overexposed parts. good job</td>', 'The compostion of the clusters of people in the sort of ''empty'' water is what I like, interesting too the water is white, nice shades and tones and still did not have any overexposed parts. good job', '2003-07-23 00:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(364021, 29774, 7969, '<td valign="top">I am partial to shots like this, where you can look through something and see clearly still what is in background.  (or in view).  The angle you have chosen to stand at really adds to the shot making it feel like has an extra dimension IMO, that works quite successfully.  Looks like the kind of cabin I would like to stay in too, do they take reservations?  :  )</td>', 'I am partial to shots like this, where you can look through something and see clearly still what is in background.  (or in view).  The angle you have chosen to stand at really adds to the shot making it feel like has an extra dimension IMO, that works quite successfully.  Looks like the kind of cabin I would like to stay in too, do they take reservations?  :  )', '2003-07-23 00:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(364250, 29651, 4767, '<td valign="top">Lovely contrast, indeed.</td>', 'Lovely contrast, indeed.', '2003-07-23 03:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(364981, 29768, 5272, '<td valign="top">nice contrast...so simple in creative with a nice title...and I really like the golden end of the pen..good job</td>', 'nice contrast...so simple in creative with a nice title...and I really like the golden end of the pen..good job', '2003-07-23 13:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
