(365069, 29598, 7969, '<td valign="top">What I do like about your shot is the shadow that looks like a sailboat of sorts, and I also like the way the light hits the left., what I dont like as much is that the subject is too centered, and the objects on left are a bit obscured by the shadow.  I like that you tried to do something a little different.</td>', 'What I do like about your shot is the shadow that looks like a sailboat of sorts, and I also like the way the light hits the left., what I dont like as much is that the subject is too centered, and the objects on left are a bit obscured by the shadow.  I like that you tried to do something a little different.', '2003-07-23 15:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(365070, 29767, 7969, '<td valign="top">Well , I like where you placed the subject and the feeling of space around it gives it the  ''alone'' feel,  I am not sure however what that subject is nor do I find it holds my attn. for long.  Another words I find it low in wow factor, sorry.  I do like the little white speckles.</td>', 'Well , I like where you placed the subject and the feeling of space around it gives it the  ''alone'' feel,  I am not sure however what that subject is nor do I find it holds my attn. for long.  Another words I find it low in wow factor, sorry.  I do like the little white speckles.', '2003-07-23 15:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
