(365213, 29723, 1379, '<td valign="top">While I appreciate the attempt at humor, this is in pretty poor taste, especially considering that some of the voters are children. You did a great job of juxtaposing two contrasting icons, but it just seems rather crude and base.</td>', 'While I appreciate the attempt at humor, this is in pretty poor taste, especially considering that some of the voters are children. You did a great job of juxtaposing two contrasting icons, but it just seems rather crude and base.', '2003-07-23 18:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
