(365535, 29591, 7969, '<td valign="top">A good shot, tho I wish the chuch was either more or less darkened as it is I want to see more of the details, yet I can''t quite see them, yet not dark enough to be silhouetted.  Still is clear, with nice composition and lighting. good work<br/></td>', 'A good shot, tho I wish the chuch was either more or less darkened as it is I want to see more of the details, yet I can''t quite see them, yet not dark enough to be silhouetted.  Still is clear, with nice composition and lighting. good work', '2003-07-23 23:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(365540, 29297, 7969, '<td valign="top">Great details in your shot, the ''hairs'' on the flower, spider,  pollen, the texture of the petals.  Very nice</td>', 'Great details in your shot, the ''hairs'' on the flower, spider,  pollen, the texture of the petals.  Very nice', '2003-07-23 23:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
