(365542, 29704, 7969, '<td valign="top">I must say the titles got me stumped, as do the large concrete?? what are they?? Makes for an interesting abstract shot.  I like it.  Nice light and compostion too.</td>', 'I must say the titles got me stumped, as do the large concrete?? what are they?? Makes for an interesting abstract shot.  I like it.  Nice light and compostion too.', '2003-07-23 23:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(365543, 29745, 10167, '<td valign="top">I like this picture very much...  Thee lighting is perfect.  The composition and arrangement are interesting.  If I had to be nit-picky about something, it would be that the top Oreo is spun around in a way that no white filling shows...  But I still think this is a great photo.  Good job!</td>', 'I like this picture very much...  Thee lighting is perfect.  The composition and arrangement are interesting.  If I had to be nit-picky about something, it would be that the top Oreo is spun around in a way that no white filling shows...  But I still think this is a great photo.  Good job!', '2003-07-23 23:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(365544, 29733, 7969, '<td valign="top">I like the dark silohuette against dark background, the reflection I think would be nicer slightly less ''bright''.  compostion is pleasing tho as is the line of light on the top of the hat.</td>', 'I like the dark silohuette against dark background, the reflection I think would be nicer slightly less ''bright''.  compostion is pleasing tho as is the line of light on the top of the hat.', '2003-07-23 23:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(365547, 29715, 10167, '<td valign="top">Simple and elegant.  The angle you chose to shoot from was perfect, and the contrast can''t be missed.  Good job!</td>', 'Simple and elegant.  The angle you chose to shoot from was perfect, and the contrast can''t be missed.  Good job!', '2003-07-23 23:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(365548, 29367, 10167, '<td valign="top">Loads of contrast here...  Really like this shot!  The only thing I find a little distracting is the greenish tint in the upper portion of the shot, especially over on the left side.  Makes it look like it was desaturated, but a small range of colors was missed.  Otherwise, really nice though.  Good job!</td>', 'Loads of contrast here...  Really like this shot!  The only thing I find a little distracting is the greenish tint in the upper portion of the shot, especially over on the left side.  Makes it look like it was desaturated, but a small range of colors was missed.  Otherwise, really nice though.  Good job!', '2003-07-23 23:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(365550, 29737, 10167, '<td valign="top">I like this...  Good idea!  Great lighting too...</td>', 'I like this...  Good idea!  Great lighting too...', '2003-07-23 23:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
