(365656, 29746, 4514, '<td valign="top">El-Shadai<br/>Wonderful shot.  Excellent lighting.  What can I say that would improve this picture even more?  It would have to be the streetlight and the Power Pole in the bottom.  Would have angled up a little more to get rid of them.  Your idea is just wonderful. Nice use of Gods Light.  :-)<br/> <br/> <br/>John (TurboTech)</td>', 'El-ShadaiWonderful shot.  Excellent lighting.  What can I say that would improve this picture even more?  It would have to be the streetlight and the Power Pole in the bottom.  Would have angled up a little more to get rid of them.  Your idea is just wonderful. Nice use of Gods Light.  :-)  John (TurboTech)', '2003-07-24 01:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(365662, 29774, 4514, '<td valign="top">This picture in itself is intresting.  What do I see?  I see a picture in a picture.  Makes me wonder what happened to the Roof.  It tells a story.  Contrast?  Not sure.  I have to look the word up.  "Brush Fire rips through home, Leaving family Homeless in the Mountains.  <br/> <br/></td>', 'This picture in itself is intresting.  What do I see?  I see a picture in a picture.  Makes me wonder what happened to the Roof.  It tells a story.  Contrast?  Not sure.  I have to look the word up.  "Brush Fire rips through home, Leaving family Homeless in the Mountains.   ', '2003-07-24 01:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
