(365738, 29734, 6349, '<td valign="top">i''ve seen stuff like this done on here, but done better.  nothing wrong with learning from other people or trying it for yourself, but if you''re going to submit something you should try to make it better than the ones in the past if possible or people are going to kill you on the voting.  6</td>', 'i''ve seen stuff like this done on here, but done better.  nothing wrong with learning from other people or trying it for yourself, but if you''re going to submit something you should try to make it better than the ones in the past if possible or people are going to kill you on the voting.  6', '2003-07-24 03:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(365741, 29723, 6349, '<td valign="top">huh?  absolutely ridiculous.  not to say that i don''t find it amusing, it''s just not really a good photo.  take a good photo with these elements in it and you''ll get a good score.  The lighting is just horribly mushy with a bad glare on the dildo and it has a bad yellow cast that could easily be fixed with a little levels adjustments.  basically, it''s boring even though it is supposed to be shocking.  Try some closeups of him stroking it or wearing it or something.  The blur in the fur is bad and the compositions and shadows don''t help either.  trying to be helpful here, sorry if it comes off as rude, i just think your set-up and idea could have led to some really inspiring photos.  :)</td>', 'huh?  absolutely ridiculous.  not to say that i don''t find it amusing, it''s just not really a good photo.  take a good photo with these elements in it and you''ll get a good score.  The lighting is just horribly mushy with a bad glare on the dildo and it has a bad yellow cast that could easily be fixed with a little levels adjustments.  basically, it''s boring even though it is supposed to be shocking.  Try some closeups of him stroking it or wearing it or something.  The blur in the fur is bad and the compositions and shadows don''t help either.  trying to be helpful here, sorry if it comes off as rude, i just think your set-up and idea could have led to some really inspiring photos.  :)', '2003-07-24 03:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
