(366240, 29665, 7969, '<td valign="top"><br/>i like the colors and clarity of the flower, my only sort of negaive comment is should this photo be rotated somehow? feels sideways-- but what do I know.</td>', 'i like the colors and clarity of the flower, my only sort of negaive comment is should this photo be rotated somehow? feels sideways-- but what do I know.', '2003-07-24 19:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(366250, 29582, 9576, '<td valign="top">Great idea</td>', 'Great idea', '2003-07-24 19:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(366251, 29734, 9576, '<td valign="top">9. do you think it can be done without the shadow?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-07-30 19:47:41.</i></td>', '9. do you think it can be done without the shadow?', '2003-07-24 19:50:05.000000', '2003-07-30 20:47:41.000000', 1),
(366261, 29427, 7086, '<td valign="top">Love this picture, the exposure and lighting is superb. It''s does appear to be leaning to the right slightly though, except for the right of the image, and the tonality is different on the right.</td>', 'Love this picture, the exposure and lighting is superb. It''s does appear to be leaning to the right slightly though, except for the right of the image, and the tonality is different on the right.', '2003-07-24 20:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(366264, 29599, 7086, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture and many contrasts in the image. Very good use of a border.</td>', 'Excellent capture and many contrasts in the image. Very good use of a border.', '2003-07-24 20:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(366268, 28890, 7086, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, in my top 5. Very good use of a neutral background focusing the viewer on what''s important. I would suggest however that as you appear to be showing symmetry that the positioning of the model is slightly skewed. Also the legs appear slightly softer than the rest of the body. Very good submission.</td>', 'Excellent shot, in my top 5. Very good use of a neutral background focusing the viewer on what''s important. I would suggest however that as you appear to be showing symmetry that the positioning of the model is slightly skewed. Also the legs appear slightly softer than the rest of the body. Very good submission.', '2003-07-24 20:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(366270, 29761, 7086, '<td valign="top">Love the simplicity of this shot, it almost appears to be in 3D.</td>', 'Love the simplicity of this shot, it almost appears to be in 3D.', '2003-07-24 20:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(366274, 29768, 7086, '<td valign="top">Like the simplicity, not to sure about the frame though. May be worth considering rotating the pen slightly so it points more towards the viewer.</td>', 'Like the simplicity, not to sure about the frame though. May be worth considering rotating the pen slightly so it points more towards the viewer.', '2003-07-24 20:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(366280, 29616, 7086, '<td valign="top">A contrast not many had thought of, good work. It almost appears to be black and white until you se the splashes of colour. Slightly noisy sky (sharpening?) and if you''d have taken the shot slightly later the positioning of the seats would have been more pleasing to me (no accounting for my taste though!)</td>', 'A contrast not many had thought of, good work. It almost appears to be black and white until you se the splashes of colour. Slightly noisy sky (sharpening?) and if you''d have taken the shot slightly later the positioning of the seats would have been more pleasing to me (no accounting for my taste though!)', '2003-07-24 20:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(366282, 29775, 7086, '<td valign="top">Good, strong image. May have been worth having the feather the other way round as the softer, lighter parts are lost against the stone.</td>', 'Good, strong image. May have been worth having the feather the other way round as the softer, lighter parts are lost against the stone.', '2003-07-24 20:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(366287, 29651, 7086, '<td valign="top">Very good display of contrast on many levels. Probably slightly darker than most people will like but the position of the lighting is ideal for the structure.</td>', 'Very good display of contrast on many levels. Probably slightly darker than most people will like but the position of the lighting is ideal for the structure.', '2003-07-24 20:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(366289, 29165, 7086, '<td valign="top">Don''t usually leave one word comments - Excellent</td>', 'Don''t usually leave one word comments - Excellent', '2003-07-24 20:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(366319, 29637, 9550, '<td valign="top">Great Composition!!! The Red and Silver complement each other very well. Focus and depth of field are excellent.This picture is sharp and clearly in focus. The craftmanship is great, It is nicely placed and displayed in the frame. This picture really has a story, It reminds me of the vending machine guy opening the machine and seeing all the cans neatly placed. Great Picture!</td>', 'Great Composition!!! The Red and Silver complement each other very well. Focus and depth of field are excellent.This picture is sharp and clearly in focus. The craftmanship is great, It is nicely placed and displayed in the frame. This picture really has a story, It reminds me of the vending machine guy opening the machine and seeing all the cans neatly placed. Great Picture!', '2003-07-24 21:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(366322, 29335, 6035, '<td valign="top">i love the high key of this shot, and i''ve always been partial to old twisty trees :) the top of the trunk might be a bit *too* dark though considering the tones of the rest of the shot. Good job nonetheless. 8</td>', 'i love the high key of this shot, and i''ve always been partial to old twisty trees :) the top of the trunk might be a bit *too* dark though considering the tones of the rest of the shot. Good job nonetheless. 8', '2003-07-24 21:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(366324, 29746, 6035, '<td valign="top">wow, i love skies like this. I have a few "rays of snshine" skies myself, but i never had such a great shadow to put in front :) it meakes a great composition to have this girl in a dress there. There''s a stray little pixel in the middle there, but i guess you saw that yourself (and couldn''t do a thing about it.. doh) , great shot. 8</td>', 'wow, i love skies like this. I have a few "rays of snshine" skies myself, but i never had such a great shadow to put in front :) it meakes a great composition to have this girl in a dress there. There''s a stray little pixel in the middle there, but i guess you saw that yourself (and couldn''t do a thing about it.. doh) , great shot. 8', '2003-07-24 21:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(366325, 29673, 6035, '<td valign="top">I love the tones in this image. The contrast is great, and despite the high contrast, nothing "too bright" . The bright parts of the dog might be pure white, but it goes well with the photo. good job, 8</td>', 'I love the tones in this image. The contrast is great, and despite the high contrast, nothing "too bright" . The bright parts of the dog might be pure white, but it goes well with the photo. good job, 8', '2003-07-24 21:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(366327, 29769, 6035, '<td valign="top">It''s a ncie idea, and the little hand is certainly cute, and the contrast is definatly there, the lighting is what sort of "breaks" the shot. If this was an onboard flash, there''s not much you can do, but with a little creativity, you can get your flash to bounce off the ceiling (i sometimes use a cd to bounce the light). This creates a softer flash, and prevents the harsh shadows created by a flash. then again, i could always be completly wrong that it was a flash.. in any case, the harsher shadows isn''t the bes quality of this photo. Good attempt though, 6.</td>', 'It''s a ncie idea, and the little hand is certainly cute, and the contrast is definatly there, the lighting is what sort of "breaks" the shot. If this was an onboard flash, there''s not much you can do, but with a little creativity, you can get your flash to bounce off the ceiling (i sometimes use a cd to bounce the light). This creates a softer flash, and prevents the harsh shadows created by a flash. then again, i could always be completly wrong that it was a flash.. in any case, the harsher shadows isn''t the bes quality of this photo. Good attempt though, 6.', '2003-07-24 21:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(366330, 29131, 6035, '<td valign="top">I love the texture in this shot. a great example of high contrast too. it looks almost.. surreal, with a drawn-like quality. great shot. 9</td>', 'I love the texture in this shot. a great example of high contrast too. it looks almost.. surreal, with a drawn-like quality. great shot. 9', '2003-07-24 21:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(366376, 29668, 7556, '<td valign="top">Really nice abstract...</td>', 'Really nice abstract...', '2003-07-24 23:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(366391, 29297, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like the clarity you have captured here as well as the contrasts between the dark and light, and the plant and "animal."  Nice work.</td>', 'I really like the clarity you have captured here as well as the contrasts between the dark and light, and the plant and "animal."  Nice work.', '2003-07-25 00:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(366393, 29165, 811, '<td valign="top">The focus is great and I love the soft feeling this shot has.  Very well done.</td>', 'The focus is great and I love the soft feeling this shot has.  Very well done.', '2003-07-25 00:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(366394, 29599, 811, '<td valign="top">Very touching.  I wanted to do something like this, but my younger model (18 mos) didn''t seem to want to cooperate!! :-)  I think the black and white adds a nice effect, and probably helps to even out the skin tones, some.</td>', 'Very touching.  I wanted to do something like this, but my younger model (18 mos) didn''t seem to want to cooperate!! :-)  I think the black and white adds a nice effect, and probably helps to even out the skin tones, some.', '2003-07-25 00:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(366396, 29668, 811, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, and very graceful looking.</td>', 'Great lighting, and very graceful looking.', '2003-07-25 00:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(366397, 29427, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like the contrast between the "roundness" of the flower and the strong vertical lines of the blinds (?).  Great bw.</td>', 'I really like the contrast between the "roundness" of the flower and the strong vertical lines of the blinds (?).  Great bw.', '2003-07-25 00:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(366398, 29733, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the effect of the light on the water in this.  Nicely done.</td>', 'I like the effect of the light on the water in this.  Nicely done.', '2003-07-25 00:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(366401, 29723, 811, '<td valign="top">The focus seems a bit soft, and the lighting seems way off.  Maybe a bit brighter, and adjustment of white balance would make this a better photograph.</td>', 'The focus seems a bit soft, and the lighting seems way off.  Maybe a bit brighter, and adjustment of white balance would make this a better photograph.', '2003-07-25 00:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(366402, 29271, 2337, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been a much stronger image rotated right 90deg...<br/> <br/>But that''s just me</td>', 'I think this would have been a much stronger image rotated right 90deg... But that''s just me', '2003-07-25 00:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(366403, 29774, 811, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what my opinion is on this one.  It seems like the colors could be boosted a little, yet the drab/flat colors suit the subject well.  Overall, the shot seem a little grainy/not clear.</td>', 'I''m not sure what my opinion is on this one.  It seems like the colors could be boosted a little, yet the drab/flat colors suit the subject well.  Overall, the shot seem a little grainy/not clear.', '2003-07-25 00:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(366404, 29598, 811, '<td valign="top">More light on the left perhaps is needed.  Also, I think a tighter crop would help give the shot more impact.</td>', 'More light on the left perhaps is needed.  Also, I think a tighter crop would help give the shot more impact.', '2003-07-25 00:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(366405, 29599, 2337, '<td valign="top">Congratulation... Hang it on a wall.</td>', 'Congratulation... Hang it on a wall.', '2003-07-25 00:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(366406, 29618, 811, '<td valign="top">If the emphasis was on the red and yellow, I think a tighter crop would work better.  If it was on the shadow/not shadow part, I think a wider crop would be in order.  Nice brilliant colors, though.</td>', 'If the emphasis was on the red and yellow, I think a tighter crop would work better.  If it was on the shadow/not shadow part, I think a wider crop would be in order.  Nice brilliant colors, though.', '2003-07-25 00:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(366408, 29271, 811, '<td valign="top">The horizontal framing of this seems rather odd, but I will assume that is what you meant to do. I think it needs a bit more contrast overall.  It just seems to be muted grays.</td>', 'The horizontal framing of this seems rather odd, but I will assume that is what you meant to do. I think it needs a bit more contrast overall.  It just seems to be muted grays.', '2003-07-25 00:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(366409, 29763, 811, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.  Maybe if there were more "space" on the left, there would be more shadow to contrast with the sun shine.</td>', 'Interesting idea.  Maybe if there were more "space" on the left, there would be more shadow to contrast with the sun shine.', '2003-07-25 00:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(366411, 29056, 811, '<td valign="top">Cropping off the shadow at the bottom may have made the crane''s shadow stand out even more, perhaps.  Overall, the shot is a bit "flat" to me.</td>', 'Cropping off the shadow at the bottom may have made the crane''s shadow stand out even more, perhaps.  Overall, the shot is a bit "flat" to me.', '2003-07-25 00:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(366413, 29094, 811, '<td valign="top">Interesting juxaposition between the mural and car.  I think a faster shutter speed to get the car clearly in focus, or a slower one to get more motion would help.  Also, more of the care (vertically) is needed, I think, for more impact.</td>', 'Interesting juxaposition between the mural and car.  I think a faster shutter speed to get the car clearly in focus, or a slower one to get more motion would help.  Also, more of the care (vertically) is needed, I think, for more impact.', '2003-07-25 00:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(366416, 29769, 811, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  A solid background would have really helped this shot -- or converting to bw so that the "obviousness" of the different colors wouldn''t be noticed.</td>', 'Great idea.  A solid background would have really helped this shot -- or converting to bw so that the "obviousness" of the different colors wouldn''t be noticed.', '2003-07-25 00:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(366417, 29746, 2337, '<td valign="top">Fantastic image. Congratulations!</td>', 'Fantastic image. Congratulations!', '2003-07-25 00:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(366418, 29567, 811, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  I don''t know if it was possible or if it would have helped, but showng more of a straight on shot so that the truck was even more visible might have given more drama to the shot.</td>', 'Great capture.  I don''t know if it was possible or if it would have helped, but showng more of a straight on shot so that the truck was even more visible might have given more drama to the shot.', '2003-07-25 00:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(366421, 29559, 2337, '<td valign="top">The HM is the only reason I''m commenting... This is a ''nice'' effort, but lacks any interest.  There''s no subject to speak of...<br/> <br/>But that''s just me...</td>', 'The HM is the only reason I''m commenting... This is a ''nice'' effort, but lacks any interest.  There''s no subject to speak of... But that''s just me...', '2003-07-25 00:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(366425, 29581, 10241, '<td valign="top">Don''t look like fox gloves 2 me :(</td>', 'Don''t look like fox gloves 2 me :(', '2003-07-25 00:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(366426, 29727, 4967, '<td valign="top">Hot Hot Hot... :-)  I love the water flecks on the pepppers.  Very good lighting here as well.  Nicely done... I like the fact also that you used the two different types of peppers.  I would maybe have cropped down a little of the white.. but otherwise good job.</td>', 'Hot Hot Hot... :-)  I love the water flecks on the pepppers.  Very good lighting here as well.  Nicely done... I like the fact also that you used the two different types of peppers.  I would maybe have cropped down a little of the white.. but otherwise good job.', '2003-07-25 00:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(366430, 29483, 7033, '<td valign="top">Nice shot that meets the challenge a couple of ways, in my opinion.  Not only is the whiteness of the flower contrasting with the darkness of the rest of the shot, its sharp lines contrast quite nicely with the rounded lines of the lily pads.  That said, I would give it a higher score if the flower were better exposed and less blown-out.  --7</td>', 'Nice shot that meets the challenge a couple of ways, in my opinion.  Not only is the whiteness of the flower contrasting with the darkness of the rest of the shot, its sharp lines contrast quite nicely with the rounded lines of the lily pads.  That said, I would give it a higher score if the flower were better exposed and less blown-out.  --7', '2003-07-25 00:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(366437, 28869, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot, compositionally, but a bit too over-processed for my taste.</td>', 'Very interesting shot, compositionally, but a bit too over-processed for my taste.', '2003-07-25 00:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(366461, 29715, 4258, '<td valign="top">I hope to see this among the winners - I love the texture details visible on the keys</td>', 'I hope to see this among the winners - I love the texture details visible on the keys', '2003-07-25 01:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(366464, 29372, 4258, '<td valign="top">Nice composition - May be you should try putting this thru NeatImage for noise reduction</td>', 'Nice composition - May be you should try putting this thru NeatImage for noise reduction', '2003-07-25 01:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(366465, 29163, 4258, '<td valign="top">Would like the picture more if it was less grainy</td>', 'Would like the picture more if it was less grainy', '2003-07-25 01:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(366467, 29723, 4258, '<td valign="top">I find the picture in poor taste :(</td>', 'I find the picture in poor taste :(', '2003-07-25 01:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(366551, 29324, 10423, '<td valign="top">This image is great, I love the texture and pattern.</td>', 'This image is great, I love the texture and pattern.', '2003-07-25 08:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(366571, 29483, 8298, '<td valign="top">hehe. round</td>', 'hehe. round', '2003-07-25 09:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(366578, 29131, 8860, '<td valign="top">A little too weak for the challenge brief perhaps, but it''s a great shot with lovely tones and - not surprisingly - contrast! [7]</td>', 'A little too weak for the challenge brief perhaps, but it''s a great shot with lovely tones and - not surprisingly - contrast! [7]', '2003-07-25 09:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(366580, 29453, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice quality pic - the green/black duo''s a little strange but it''s good. [7]</td>', 'Nice quality pic - the green/black duo''s a little strange but it''s good. [7]', '2003-07-25 09:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(366582, 29559, 8860, '<td valign="top">Like the design in this - and a nice mix of materials/light and dark contrasts going on. [8]</td>', 'Like the design in this - and a nice mix of materials/light and dark contrasts going on. [8]', '2003-07-25 09:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(366585, 29444, 8860, '<td valign="top">I''d have cropped the right edge I think. Nice viewpoint and it fits the challenge nicely too. Wonder if black and white would be good for this - it might emphasise the textures more?</td>', 'I''d have cropped the right edge I think. Nice viewpoint and it fits the challenge nicely too. Wonder if black and white would be good for this - it might emphasise the textures more?', '2003-07-25 09:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(366586, 29770, 8860, '<td valign="top">Intriguing shot with some interesting textures. I find myself wanting the background area in focus as well though so a longer DOF would have improved it slightly. [8]</td>', 'Intriguing shot with some interesting textures. I find myself wanting the background area in focus as well though so a longer DOF would have improved it slightly. [8]', '2003-07-25 09:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(366588, 29753, 8860, '<td valign="top">A single ''horizon line'' of velvet would have worked bettter for me (right across the shot) - so that the blade has the illusion of appearing against a pitch black sky. The border is too large and distracting too, especially with the dark subject matter. [5]</td>', 'A single ''horizon line'' of velvet would have worked bettter for me (right across the shot) - so that the blade has the illusion of appearing against a pitch black sky. The border is too large and distracting too, especially with the dark subject matter. [5]', '2003-07-25 09:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(366596, 29581, 8860, '<td valign="top">i see what you''re getting at. However this shot does not engage the viewer as there is nothing about the composition to draw one in. The items are too central and the angle is unimaginitive. By getting closer to your subject and choosing a more interesting viewing angle this could have been made more interesting. Do you need to see all of the flowers in the vase? You could have cropped some out in order to get more detail and texture. Otherwise just off-setting the vases to left or right would create more ''active'' space.</td>', 'i see what you''re getting at. However this shot does not engage the viewer as there is nothing about the composition to draw one in. The items are too central and the angle is unimaginitive. By getting closer to your subject and choosing a more interesting viewing angle this could have been made more interesting. Do you need to see all of the flowers in the vase? You could have cropped some out in order to get more detail and texture. Otherwise just off-setting the vases to left or right would create more ''active'' space.', '2003-07-25 09:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(366599, 29483, 8860, '<td valign="top">Despite being a tad over sharpened this is a very nice shot. The lily would have benefited from being further off-centre (right) which would prevent the grass ''touching'' the lily. [6]</td>', 'Despite being a tad over sharpened this is a very nice shot. The lily would have benefited from being further off-centre (right) which would prevent the grass ''touching'' the lily. [6]', '2003-07-25 09:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(366600, 29108, 8860, '<td valign="top">Good composition and mood.</td>', 'Good composition and mood.', '2003-07-25 09:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(366601, 29663, 7086, '<td valign="top">Well shot, light isn''t too overpowering on the mask. Background is slightly distracting on the right.</td>', 'Well shot, light isn''t too overpowering on the mask. Background is slightly distracting on the right.', '2003-07-25 09:40:40.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(366603, 29591, 7086, '<td valign="top">Noisy sky and halo around the building. Might have been worth trying to shoot from the other side to illuminate the bulding more.</td>', 'Noisy sky and halo around the building. Might have been worth trying to shoot from the other side to illuminate the bulding more.', '2003-07-25 09:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(366604, 29603, 7086, '<td valign="top">The lack of detail in the foreground spoils the image but it''s understandable, cropping the lower 1/8th off may improve it as there is still enough contrast in the sky. It may be worth considering getting graduated ND filters if your camera can use them.</td>', 'The lack of detail in the foreground spoils the image but it''s understandable, cropping the lower 1/8th off may improve it as there is still enough contrast in the sky. It may be worth considering getting graduated ND filters if your camera can use them.', '2003-07-25 09:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(366637, 29165, 9146, '<td valign="top">I love that border</td>', 'I love that border', '2003-07-25 11:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(366687, 29616, 1439, '<td valign="top">very nice 9.</td>', 'very nice 9.', '2003-07-25 12:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(366689, 29674, 1280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!!!  I love it....really! 10</td>', 'Beautiful!!!  I love it....really! 10', '2003-07-25 12:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(366694, 29675, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice example. A little dark on my monitor.</td>', 'Nice example. A little dark on my monitor.', '2003-07-25 12:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(366696, 29387, 1280, '<td valign="top">Lovely but the focus is soft.</td>', 'Lovely but the focus is soft.', '2003-07-25 12:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(366698, 29762, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good idea and well executed.</td>', 'Good idea and well executed.', '2003-07-25 12:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(366701, 29663, 1280, '<td valign="top">Unique, and eye-catching. Certainly meets the challenge.</td>', 'Unique, and eye-catching. Certainly meets the challenge.', '2003-07-25 12:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(366704, 29628, 1280, '<td valign="top">This is excellent!!!  The patterns are so cool, the composition is superb, and the lighting highlights the texture.  10 from me!!!</td>', 'This is excellent!!!  The patterns are so cool, the composition is superb, and the lighting highlights the texture.  10 from me!!!', '2003-07-25 12:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(366711, 29686, 1280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful job!!!  For this challenge the contrast is minimal though.  I would give you a 10 for camouflage, or nature, or green,  but the main subject is supposed to be contrast.  I''m usually very open-minded in my voting,  but this picture really isn''t about contrast.  So I feel compelled to give you half that.  5<br/>Keep up the great work,  and in future challenges,  it would be best to stick with the challenge subject.  I understand why you''d want to show this though.  It''s beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful job!!!  For this challenge the contrast is minimal though.  I would give you a 10 for camouflage, or nature, or green,  but the main subject is supposed to be contrast.  I''m usually very open-minded in my voting,  but this picture really isn''t about contrast.  So I feel compelled to give you half that.  5Keep up the great work,  and in future challenges,  it would be best to stick with the challenge subject.  I understand why you''d want to show this though.  It''s beautiful.', '2003-07-25 12:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(366718, 29729, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice setup!!!</td>', 'Nice setup!!!', '2003-07-25 12:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(366723, 29492, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good contrast of textures here.  Is this part of a mining area?  I lived near a titanium mine and the resulting landscape looked like this.  Reminds me of another planet. Good job!</td>', 'Good contrast of textures here.  Is this part of a mining area?  I lived near a titanium mine and the resulting landscape looked like this.  Reminds me of another planet. Good job!', '2003-07-25 12:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
