(367105, 29746, 1280, '<td valign="top">The concept bares witness in my heart, since I believe strongly in doing so. (I did a whole lot more of it when I was younger though.)  <br/>The bg sky is a perfect setting, and the color and exposure are good.  For the most part I like the composition, but I think it would be a more dramatic image if the legs and feet of the hilariously joyful dancer were included.  Especially since they are an important element in dance.<br/>All in all you have inspired me. :-) +      8</td>', 'The concept bares witness in my heart, since I believe strongly in doing so. (I did a whole lot more of it when I was younger though.)  The bg sky is a perfect setting, and the color and exposure are good.  For the most part I like the composition, but I think it would be a more dramatic image if the legs and feet of the hilariously joyful dancer were included.  Especially since they are an important element in dance.All in all you have inspired me. :-) +      8', '2003-07-25 23:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
