(367436, 29701, 3730, '<td valign="top">Perfect 10 - love the mood, the subject, the light....clever title :)</td>', 'Perfect 10 - love the mood, the subject, the light....clever title :)', '2003-07-26 17:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(367437, 29389, 3730, '<td valign="top">Stunning work...sure meets the challenge, your subject is very interesting, and the lighting is simply magnificent...great job! 10</td>', 'Stunning work...sure meets the challenge, your subject is very interesting, and the lighting is simply magnificent...great job! 10', '2003-07-26 17:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(367439, 29668, 3730, '<td valign="top">Had to give this a 10....the soft lighting is perfect, exposure is dead on, symmetry makes it a very interesting photo to look at...i''d create a series with different colors and put them side by side...great work!</td>', 'Had to give this a 10....the soft lighting is perfect, exposure is dead on, symmetry makes it a very interesting photo to look at...i''d create a series with different colors and put them side by side...great work!', '2003-07-26 17:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(367440, 29736, 3730, '<td valign="top">Best contrast showing this week, IMO. very interesting texture to look at. Like how the composition leads my eye in every direction....great job- 10</td>', 'Best contrast showing this week, IMO. very interesting texture to look at. Like how the composition leads my eye in every direction....great job- 10', '2003-07-26 17:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(367442, 29723, 3730, '<td valign="top">Nah....this don''t work very well (technically and artistically), IMO - 2</td>', 'Nah....this don''t work very well (technically and artistically), IMO - 2', '2003-07-26 17:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(367443, 29655, 3730, '<td valign="top">I can''t quite see the contrast in this photo....it seems quite flat, actually, IMO. The grass blades on the bottom are very distracting.</td>', 'I can''t quite see the contrast in this photo....it seems quite flat, actually, IMO. The grass blades on the bottom are very distracting.', '2003-07-26 17:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(367446, 29581, 3730, '<td valign="top">Looks too much like a quick snapshop. The subject is too close to the backdrop, and when using a flash it creates ''ugly'' shadows - try moving your subject away from the back, or use a window/lamp as your light source. Also the placement of your subject is too centered - try different compositions. (just my thoughts)</td>', 'Looks too much like a quick snapshop. The subject is too close to the backdrop, and when using a flash it creates ''ugly'' shadows - try moving your subject away from the back, or use a window/lamp as your light source. Also the placement of your subject is too centered - try different compositions. (just my thoughts)', '2003-07-26 17:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(367454, 29746, 3087, '<td valign="top">Oooh this is lovely!<br/>The contrast between the silhouette and the striking, cloud-filtered sunlight is beautiful! <br/>Position of the little girl within the frame doesn''t feel quite balanced and the position of the knee/ leg at the lower right looks a little strange - might be better straight down like the other leg.<br/>Poles at lower left are a minor distraction, not a real problem.</td>', 'Oooh this is lovely!The contrast between the silhouette and the striking, cloud-filtered sunlight is beautiful! Position of the little girl within the frame doesn''t feel quite balanced and the position of the knee/ leg at the lower right looks a little strange - might be better straight down like the other leg.Poles at lower left are a minor distraction, not a real problem.', '2003-07-26 18:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(367456, 29651, 5112, '<td valign="top">Saw this at Usefilm.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Saw this at Usefilm.  Nice shot.', '2003-07-26 18:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(367459, 29563, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Such a peaceful place, just beautiful.  ~10</td>', 'Beautiful!  Such a peaceful place, just beautiful.  ~10', '2003-07-26 18:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(367467, 29578, 10614, '<td valign="top">Excellent contrast.  Love the theme you chose. A cemetary is a dark place, but the light and the child makes it less somber.  Wish I could vote!!! I''d rate it a 10.</td>', 'Excellent contrast.  Love the theme you chose. A cemetary is a dark place, but the light and the child makes it less somber.  Wish I could vote!!! I''d rate it a 10.', '2003-07-26 19:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(367471, 29493, 10614, '<td valign="top">EXCELLENT!!!!  Two thumbs up. I''m new to website &amp; unable to vote, but after seeing this, I wish I could.  Great Job.  Let me know when prints are available.</td>', 'EXCELLENT!!!!  Two thumbs up. I''m new to website & unable to vote, but after seeing this, I wish I could.  Great Job.  Let me know when prints are available.', '2003-07-26 19:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(367474, 29165, 4767, '<td valign="top">Man, I ALMOST love this image.  What happened on the edges?  If it''s lighting, respond and I''ll raise my vote.  If it''s a ''frame'' - it ruined a great shot, imnho.</td>', 'Man, I ALMOST love this image.  What happened on the edges?  If it''s lighting, respond and I''ll raise my vote.  If it''s a ''frame'' - it ruined a great shot, imnho.', '2003-07-26 19:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(367475, 29691, 4767, '<td valign="top">Neon lighting?  Cool!  (otherwise. how''d it get so pink on top???)</td>', 'Neon lighting?  Cool!  (otherwise. how''d it get so pink on top???)', '2003-07-26 19:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(367477, 29550, 4767, '<td valign="top">I wish we could see the top of the foreground wing.  Lovely photo otherwise.</td>', 'I wish we could see the top of the foreground wing.  Lovely photo otherwise.', '2003-07-26 19:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(367478, 29372, 4767, '<td valign="top">BOTH are bigger then mine in my garden!  Nice response to the theme.</td>', 'BOTH are bigger then mine in my garden!  Nice response to the theme.', '2003-07-26 19:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(367493, 29493, 8722, '<td valign="top">Wow, what an amzing photo! I expect very high for this one! Great job, very well done. Exsquisite, emotional, and terrific, very well done.</td>', 'Wow, what an amzing photo! I expect very high for this one! Great job, very well done. Exsquisite, emotional, and terrific, very well done.', '2003-07-26 20:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(367494, 29598, 8722, '<td valign="top">I like this. Good job. - 8</td>', 'I like this. Good job. - 8', '2003-07-26 20:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(367500, 29578, 8722, '<td valign="top">Absolutely astonishing. Very emotional, and fits this challenge very well. The Shadows of the trees give off a dreary sense, along with the girl crying at the tombstone. Very well done. - 10</td>', 'Absolutely astonishing. Very emotional, and fits this challenge very well. The Shadows of the trees give off a dreary sense, along with the girl crying at the tombstone. Very well done. - 10', '2003-07-26 20:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(367505, 29765, 8722, '<td valign="top">Thats quite amzing, do tell what shutter speed you put this baby on!</td>', 'Thats quite amzing, do tell what shutter speed you put this baby on!', '2003-07-26 20:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(367507, 29734, 8722, '<td valign="top">This is a VERY nice picture. Good job!</td>', 'This is a VERY nice picture. Good job!', '2003-07-26 20:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(367533, 29727, 8953, '<td valign="top">This one was my favorite this challenge. the lighting was grerat as was your DOF. I know it would have been hard to do but my only wish is that the fabric under the peppers was  just a little lighter. still a 9 from me! Good Luck. Richard</td>', 'This one was my favorite this challenge. the lighting was grerat as was your DOF. I know it would have been hard to do but my only wish is that the fabric under the peppers was  just a little lighter. still a 9 from me! Good Luck. Richard', '2003-07-26 21:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(367536, 29749, 8953, '<td valign="top">hey! where is the Contrast??? No no :) Just kidding. I love this shot and the choice of contrasting colors...(Not just black and white) you did a great job! The only part that takes from this is the fact you lost her form at her right hip.still tops in my book. 8</td>', 'hey! where is the Contrast??? No no :) Just kidding. I love this shot and the choice of contrasting colors...(Not just black and white) you did a great job! The only part that takes from this is the fact you lost her form at her right hip.still tops in my book. 8', '2003-07-26 21:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(367537, 29746, 8953, '<td valign="top">A wonderful shot:) the sepia  works well here and the young lady does give the feeling of joy. I feel the spirit of the shot. the one thing that hurts this for me is what appears to be extra fabric hanging from her dress. still an 8 from me:)</td>', 'A wonderful shot:) the sepia  works well here and the young lady does give the feeling of joy. I feel the spirit of the shot. the one thing that hurts this for me is what appears to be extra fabric hanging from her dress. still an 8 from me:)', '2003-07-26 21:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(367538, 29615, 8953, '<td valign="top">clever Idea! and that by itself made me rate this high. add to that very good focus as well as the lighting from out in front and a little low with out blowing out the detail made the rest work for me. Thanks 8</td>', 'clever Idea! and that by itself made me rate this high. add to that very good focus as well as the lighting from out in front and a little low with out blowing out the detail made the rest work for me. Thanks 8', '2003-07-26 21:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(367539, 29483, 8953, '<td valign="top">A wonderful capture. nice contrast idea. the only thing that i had trouble with was that darn leaf the is just to the right of the flower. still a 8 from me</td>', 'A wonderful capture. nice contrast idea. the only thing that i had trouble with was that darn leaf the is just to the right of the flower. still a 8 from me', '2003-07-26 21:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
