(367849, 29663, 5728, '<td valign="top">he? A two way mask? Never seen anything like that before. Good lighting by the way. I just don''t really like the seam showing at the back there and a couple of white dots on the image. But you can''t really do anything about it without spot editing right. Otherwise a good submission!</td>', 'he? A two way mask? Never seen anything like that before. Good lighting by the way. I just don''t really like the seam showing at the back there and a couple of white dots on the image. But you can''t really do anything about it without spot editing right. Otherwise a good submission!', '2003-07-27 17:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(367850, 29394, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good macro here and very color contrasty. Not really too much to critique about on this pic, way to go!</td>', 'Good macro here and very color contrasty. Not really too much to critique about on this pic, way to go!', '2003-07-27 17:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
