(367860, 29715, 5728, '<td valign="top">I thought I''d see more piano shots but this is nearly the only one! Very good I like it.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-07-28 03:47:52.</i></td>', 'I thought I''d see more piano shots but this is nearly the only one! Very good I like it.', '2003-07-27 17:21:15.000000', '2003-07-28 04:47:52.000000', 1),
