(367866, 29728, 5728, '<td valign="top">Funny photo, original!</td>', 'Funny photo, original!', '2003-07-27 17:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(367880, 29745, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very nice... now where''s the milk?  :-)  Now for the serious part... I like the multiple contrasts in the shot-- black against white, eaten versus uneaten, horizontal versus vertical... all add interest to a technically superb shot.  The pure white border against the slightly off-white background also works well.  My favorite so far!  --10</td>', 'Very nice... now where''s the milk?  :-)  Now for the serious part... I like the multiple contrasts in the shot-- black against white, eaten versus uneaten, horizontal versus vertical... all add interest to a technically superb shot.  The pure white border against the slightly off-white background also works well.  My favorite so far!  --10', '2003-07-27 18:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(367884, 29737, 7033, '<td valign="top">Fantastic tonal range... and plenty of contrasts.  The sharp teeth of the hole saw against the roundness of the rest of the saw, and the contrast in the background and lighting all are VERY nice.  --10</td>', 'Fantastic tonal range... and plenty of contrasts.  The sharp teeth of the hole saw against the roundness of the rest of the saw, and the contrast in the background and lighting all are VERY nice.  --10', '2003-07-27 18:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(367885, 29427, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, technically.  I like the contrast of both the lighitng and the sharp edges of the plant against the smooth, almost rounded background and vase.  One nitpick is that the shot is not perfectly vertical-- this detracts significantly, in my opinion.  --8</td>', 'Very nice shot, technically.  I like the contrast of both the lighitng and the sharp edges of the plant against the smooth, almost rounded background and vase.  One nitpick is that the shot is not perfectly vertical-- this detracts significantly, in my opinion.  --8', '2003-07-27 18:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(367887, 29727, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot; I really like the concept behind it.  A couple of things that detract, in my opinion are the yellowish shadows against the stark white background, and the dark edges of the peppers in the foreground.  I''m not certain what created the effect, but perhaps lighting, or even different post-processing steps could reduce it.  --7</td>', 'Very nice shot; I really like the concept behind it.  A couple of things that detract, in my opinion are the yellowish shadows against the stark white background, and the dark edges of the peppers in the foreground.  I''m not certain what created the effect, but perhaps lighting, or even different post-processing steps could reduce it.  --7', '2003-07-27 18:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(367888, 29657, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot... I especially love the broad range of tones and colors you have captured here.  The natural framing is a nice touch.</td>', 'Very nice shot... I especially love the broad range of tones and colors you have captured here.  The natural framing is a nice touch.', '2003-07-27 18:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(367889, 29686, 7033, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, out could perhaps use some different lighting to better draw attention to the grasshopper.  There is also some odd effect visible to me in the fore- and background of the shot.  (Not a direct result of a shallow DOF).  It appears as though there is perhaps a bit too much processing in those areas, perhaps too much smoothing or blur... it looks quite grainy and pixelated, and there is some ''ringing'' around the sharper edges.  The center of the shot is very crisp and sharp, however.</td>', 'Interesting shot, out could perhaps use some different lighting to better draw attention to the grasshopper.  There is also some odd effect visible to me in the fore- and background of the shot.  (Not a direct result of a shallow DOF).  It appears as though there is perhaps a bit too much processing in those areas, perhaps too much smoothing or blur... it looks quite grainy and pixelated, and there is some ''ringing'' around the sharper edges.  The center of the shot is very crisp and sharp, however.', '2003-07-27 18:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(367893, 29415, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very nice, poignant shot!  Challenge is well met in the multiple contrasts in subjects and form throughout.  VERY nicely done!  --9</td>', 'Very nice, poignant shot!  Challenge is well met in the multiple contrasts in subjects and form throughout.  VERY nicely done!  --9', '2003-07-27 18:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(367896, 29389, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot... the black/white works well to emphasize the textures and difference in texture between the horse and the field.</td>', 'Very nice shot... the black/white works well to emphasize the textures and difference in texture between the horse and the field.', '2003-07-27 18:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(367905, 29729, 10275, '<td valign="top">Neat idea. Great contrast. My only suggestion for next time is trying off centre composition.</td>', 'Neat idea. Great contrast. My only suggestion for next time is trying off centre composition.', '2003-07-27 18:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
