(367913, 29329, 10275, '<td valign="top">This is very neat idea. I love the rust detail and colour. The dandelion throws it off centre. Among my 3 favourites in this category..... 10</td>', 'This is very neat idea. I love the rust detail and colour. The dandelion throws it off centre. Among my 3 favourites in this category..... 10', '2003-07-27 19:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(367914, 29299, 10275, '<td valign="top">Very nice colours. I like the diagonal clouds, the siluetted pole, and the soft horizon. My only suggestion is to position the horizon slightly below or above the cntre line for more dramatic feeling. Well deserved 9.</td>', 'Very nice colours. I like the diagonal clouds, the siluetted pole, and the soft horizon. My only suggestion is to position the horizon slightly below or above the cntre line for more dramatic feeling. Well deserved 9.', '2003-07-27 19:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(367918, 29774, 10275, '<td valign="top">This is a very neat idea. There is an evident contrast between the colourful nature in the window and the lack of colour on the wall. The window is dead in the centre though. So, my suggestion is to create off-centre composition for more dramatic/interesting feeling. Also the colourful part should be more in focus than the wall itself.</td>', 'This is a very neat idea. There is an evident contrast between the colourful nature in the window and the lack of colour on the wall. The window is dead in the centre though. So, my suggestion is to create off-centre composition for more dramatic/interesting feeling. Also the colourful part should be more in focus than the wall itself.', '2003-07-27 19:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(367919, 29453, 10608, '<td valign="top">I love this photo. Main reason is the combination of color. Its a pity the grid and main object is not even in focus.</td>', 'I love this photo. Main reason is the combination of color. Its a pity the grid and main object is not even in focus.', '2003-07-27 19:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
