(368025, 29769, 9098, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great way to show a family bond, and the contrasts between each member of it.  The background is a bit distracting with the green wall, and part of the mantle showing, it took my focus away from the hands themselves.</td>', 'I think this is a great way to show a family bond, and the contrasts between each member of it.  The background is a bit distracting with the green wall, and part of the mantle showing, it took my focus away from the hands themselves.', '2003-07-27 23:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(368033, 29578, 7969, '<td valign="top">The theme of your photo seems,  sad, and the imposed post processing to ''make it darker'' is good, however I think it is still clear that it is a really bright day.  Hence really dark and really overexposed parts.  The subject/ scene I find very interesting, yet I think I the bright /dark patches distracting to the subject. But what do I know.  <br/> I  do think there is lots of potential in this shot.    keep up the effort.</td>', 'The theme of your photo seems,  sad, and the imposed post processing to ''make it darker'' is good, however I think it is still clear that it is a really bright day.  Hence really dark and really overexposed parts.  The subject/ scene I find very interesting, yet I think I the bright /dark patches distracting to the subject. But what do I know.   I  do think there is lots of potential in this shot.    keep up the effort.', '2003-07-28 00:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(368034, 29545, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the way the linear direction sets up one contrast, as does the texture of the rocks and feet, adn the tan lines.  I do think cropping some of the empty part on the right would help to focus attention on the feet better, if that is what you wanted to do.</td>', 'I like the way the linear direction sets up one contrast, as does the texture of the rocks and feet, adn the tan lines.  I do think cropping some of the empty part on the right would help to focus attention on the feet better, if that is what you wanted to do.', '2003-07-28 00:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
