(368036, 29394, 811, '<td valign="top">The colors are very nice, and I like the different textures.  The lighting seems just a touch harsh on the right so, though.</td>', 'The colors are very nice, and I like the different textures.  The lighting seems just a touch harsh on the right so, though.', '2003-07-28 00:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
