(368039, 28890, 811, '<td valign="top">That makes my toes hurt.  Nice contrast between the arms and legs, and well balanced, too.  Focus seems  a bit soft to me, though it may just be me, I can''t tell.</td>', 'That makes my toes hurt.  Nice contrast between the arms and legs, and well balanced, too.  Focus seems  a bit soft to me, though it may just be me, I can''t tell.', '2003-07-28 00:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
