(368126, 29493, 200, '<td valign="top">WOW...what a wonderful surprise! I was hoping to place in the top ten...but this is even better. Thank you for your comments...I appreciate them very much. Julia</td>', 'WOW...what a wonderful surprise! I was hoping to place in the top ten...but this is even better. Thank you for your comments...I appreciate them very much. Julia', '2003-07-28 01:22:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(368127, 29761, 6870, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot and wish it would have done better. It''s good to know that some folks are pushing the boundaries of photography; this shot is a good example. Nice work!</td>', 'I really like this shot and wish it would have done better. It''s good to know that some folks are pushing the boundaries of photography; this shot is a good example. Nice work!', '2003-07-28 01:23:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(368129, 29493, 6804, '<td valign="top">I''m Glad to see this photo take a ribbon. It is my highest rated shot in the challenge. <br/>The symbol of life and death, the sky vs. the ground, black on white. This is a perfect rendition of the challenge. Congratulations</td>', 'I''m Glad to see this photo take a ribbon. It is my highest rated shot in the challenge. The symbol of life and death, the sky vs. the ground, black on white. This is a perfect rendition of the challenge. Congratulations', '2003-07-28 01:24:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(368133, 29544, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice work, Daniel! Perhaps too subtle for some folks? I love it.</td>', 'Nice work, Daniel! Perhaps too subtle for some folks? I love it.', '2003-07-28 01:27:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(368135, 29599, 1202, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the support and great comments on this picture.  <br/> <br/>I have wanted to enter a picture of these two for a long time now and I felt this challenge fit my subject material real well.   If you have a good subject it''s not so hard to make a good picture, as long as the luck holds out.<br/> <br/>I knew it was in good company all week as the lowest that it got was around 7.298 with a high of 8.00 when it first started.  It has been exciting.<br/> <br/>Thanks again!<br/> <br/>Dick<br/></td>', 'Thank you all for the support and great comments on this picture.   I have wanted to enter a picture of these two for a long time now and I felt this challenge fit my subject material real well.   If you have a good subject it''s not so hard to make a good picture, as long as the luck holds out. I knew it was in good company all week as the lowest that it got was around 7.298 with a high of 8.00 when it first started.  It has been exciting. Thanks again! Dick', '2003-07-28 01:28:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(368136, 29482, 6870, '<td valign="top">What''s this doing back here?</td>', 'What''s this doing back here?', '2003-07-28 01:28:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(368138, 29599, 5313, '<td valign="top"><br/>This was one of my favorites!  (I had several)  I just love this one and it reminded me of my own grandmother and myself many, many years ago!  Congratulations!</td>', 'This was one of my favorites!  (I had several)  I just love this one and it reminded me of my own grandmother and myself many, many years ago!  Congratulations!', '2003-07-28 01:28:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(368142, 29636, 6870, '<td valign="top">Subtle contrast--perhaps too subtle for some folks? I was hoping this shot would do much better. Nice work.</td>', 'Subtle contrast--perhaps too subtle for some folks? I was hoping this shot would do much better. Nice work.', '2003-07-28 01:30:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(368143, 29744, 6202, '<td valign="top">*Critique Club*<br/> <br/>Colors here are fantastic.  Focus is good.  Your composition is very good.  I will say exceptional photo for having taken it out the car window.<br/> <br/>I think you may have done better to avoid the border and let it stand on its own.  The border just seems to distract from the beauty of the sunset.<br/> <br/>It does meet the challenge.  Nicely done.<br/> <br/>Anna</td>', '*Critique Club* Colors here are fantastic.  Focus is good.  Your composition is very good.  I will say exceptional photo for having taken it out the car window. I think you may have done better to avoid the border and let it stand on its own.  The border just seems to distract from the beauty of the sunset. It does meet the challenge.  Nicely done. Anna', '2003-07-28 01:32:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(368146, 29599, 6597, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your ribbon. The picture was great.<br/>                       Sue</td>', 'Congratulations on your ribbon. The picture was great.                       Sue', '2003-07-28 01:33:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(368148, 29746, 5313, '<td valign="top">Lovely, Sonja!  I really liked this shot!  I thought it would be much higher in the scores.  It was one of my favorites!</td>', 'Lovely, Sonja!  I really liked this shot!  I thought it would be much higher in the scores.  It was one of my favorites!', '2003-07-28 01:38:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(368151, 29628, 7763, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your wonderful comments, I was shocked and delighted when I saw my photo here:) I haven''t been a member long, but I think I''m hooked... I really enjoy some of the outstanding photos I''ve seen at this site, and I enjoy the many different challenges<br/> <br/>Judy</td>', 'Thank you all for your wonderful comments, I was shocked and delighted when I saw my photo here:) I haven''t been a member long, but I think I''m hooked... I really enjoy some of the outstanding photos I''ve seen at this site, and I enjoy the many different challenges Judy', '2003-07-28 01:41:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(368166, 29493, 6349, '<td valign="top">wow.  i loved this photo and i''m adding it to my favorites now.  I''m very surprised and pleased to see this take a ribbon.  Congrats.  Hope to see more quality images like this winning on here in the future.</td>', 'wow.  i loved this photo and i''m adding it to my favorites now.  I''m very surprised and pleased to see this take a ribbon.  Congrats.  Hope to see more quality images like this winning on here in the future.', '2003-07-28 01:55:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(368173, 29599, 9669, '<td valign="top">congrats... I love this one.  Its the first time I gave a 10 to the one that came in first.  You came out on top in a challenge which had the best entries since I''ve been on here.  Its just perfect</td>', 'congrats... I love this one.  Its the first time I gave a 10 to the one that came in first.  You came out on top in a challenge which had the best entries since I''ve been on here.  Its just perfect', '2003-07-28 02:02:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(368182, 29765, 6405, '<td valign="top">Nice timing,good exposure,keep with the great job!</td>', 'Nice timing,good exposure,keep with the great job!', '2003-07-28 02:14:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(368198, 29599, 6477, '<td valign="top">A well deserved ribbon! absolutely great image with a deep meaning... it was my favourite for the challenge=)<br/>A great work...</td>', 'A well deserved ribbon! absolutely great image with a deep meaning... it was my favourite for the challenge=)A great work...', '2003-07-28 02:42:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(368206, 29714, 8911, '<td valign="top">I will add on this one that the composition I wanted was impossible. I tried a horizontal composition and it looked pretty awful. I''d have liked to get the white building more prominent by shooting from closer in and closer to the ground. However, I would have had to trespass on private property and stand in a marshy area I could smell all the way to where I did take the picture from...I wasn''t feeling quite that dedicated, I fear.</td>', 'I will add on this one that the composition I wanted was impossible. I tried a horizontal composition and it looked pretty awful. I''d have liked to get the white building more prominent by shooting from closer in and closer to the ground. However, I would have had to trespass on private property and stand in a marshy area I could smell all the way to where I did take the picture from...I wasn''t feeling quite that dedicated, I fear.', '2003-07-28 03:29:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(368209, 29493, 738, '<td valign="top">not bad for a chic</td>', 'not bad for a chic', '2003-07-28 03:32:13.000000', NULL, 0),
