(368523, 29493, 6388, '<td valign="top">Love that glow border, Julia.  PERFECT for this shot.  I''d be interested to know how you go the tops of the monument lit so well, while keeping the rest in shadow.<br/>Very nice work...again.<br/> <br/>P</td>', 'Love that glow border, Julia.  PERFECT for this shot.  I''d be interested to know how you go the tops of the monument lit so well, while keeping the rest in shadow.Very nice work...again. P', '2003-07-28 12:20:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(368537, 29582, 6388, '<td valign="top">Helene?  Is that you?  Never woulda guessed this was yours.  Good for you for being able to shift gears like this.  About the pic:  Your reds seem to blend a little down at the bottom, and the cable has kind of a surreal green to it.  It may be that the neat image did it.  I like that you went hard on the contrast, not just for the challenge but because it works.  This is a really fun picture.  saw the title before the pic - you got me.<br/> <br/>Pedro</td>', 'Helene?  Is that you?  Never woulda guessed this was yours.  Good for you for being able to shift gears like this.  About the pic:  Your reds seem to blend a little down at the bottom, and the cable has kind of a surreal green to it.  It may be that the neat image did it.  I like that you went hard on the contrast, not just for the challenge but because it works.  This is a really fun picture.  saw the title before the pic - you got me. Pedro', '2003-07-28 12:32:28.000000', NULL, 0),
