(368620, 29493, 2586, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic image. Considering the ''eye-level'' (midway in the momument) here, this tombstone, and you, must have been standing on the edge of a very steep ravine in order to get the clouds way below eye level.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-07-28 12:47:38.</i></td>', 'Very dramatic image. Considering the ''eye-level'' (midway in the momument) here, this tombstone, and you, must have been standing on the edge of a very steep ravine in order to get the clouds way below eye level.', '2003-07-28 13:43:46.000000', '2003-07-28 13:47:38.000000', 0),
(368630, 29335, 6458, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the great comments!<br/> <br/>I thought of a better title for this about three days after I submitted - "Time &amp; Space". Oh well.. I''m happy with its placement.<br/> <br/>-Matt<br/> <br/>p.s. Jason, it''s about 2ft high and about 18 years old. The clovers are about 5 days old.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-07-28 13:16:27.</i></td>', 'Thanks for the great comments! I thought of a better title for this about three days after I submitted - "Time & Space". Oh well.. I''m happy with its placement. -Matt p.s. Jason, it''s about 2ft high and about 18 years old. The clovers are about 5 days old.', '2003-07-28 13:46:08.000000', '2003-07-28 14:16:27.000000', 0),
