(369718, 29768, 6900, '<td valign="top">"Just a pen" - really wonder about that comment.  I thought we were going for good looking pics that had contrast...next time I''ll just find an old person and fit in the challenge somehow.  Seems that old people do well here.<br/> <br/>Oh my other shots? I kept them, but they are just eggs, just coins, just a tomato and just a piano.<br/> <br/>And if whoever gave me a 1 would be so kind as to PM me, I''d love to know what was so terrible about this shot that you likely graded it over 99% of the entries in the challenge.<br/> <br/>M<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-07-29 16:05:52.</i></td>', '"Just a pen" - really wonder about that comment.  I thought we were going for good looking pics that had contrast...next time I''ll just find an old person and fit in the challenge somehow.  Seems that old people do well here. Oh my other shots? I kept them, but they are just eggs, just coins, just a tomato and just a piano. And if whoever gave me a 1 would be so kind as to PM me, I''d love to know what was so terrible about this shot that you likely graded it over 99% of the entries in the challenge. M', '2003-07-29 17:03:51.000000', '2003-07-29 17:05:52.000000', 0),
