(373830, 29628, 6202, '<td valign="top">*Critique Club*<br/> <br/>I find this to be very interesting I like the contrast of the tones and patterns.  I think it has a wonderful feeling and texture to it.  Your dof works well and the focus seems perfect.<br/> <br/>I really wouldn''t change a thing. Congrats on the second place win.<br/> <br/>Anna</td>', '*Critique Club* I find this to be very interesting I like the contrast of the tones and patterns.  I think it has a wonderful feeling and texture to it.  Your dof works well and the focus seems perfect. I really wouldn''t change a thing. Congrats on the second place win. Anna', '2003-08-01 18:30:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(373852, 29745, 6202, '<td valign="top">*Critique Club*<br/> <br/>Very nice take on the challenge, I like the several different contrasts of ideas going here.  Your focus seems good, the dof works here you might have been hurt though by the shadow created by your diagonally placed oreo, makes the oreos in the stack slightly shadowed.<br/> <br/>Only thing you are missing here is the contrast of big and small...in cause you have no little kids around yes oreos now come in mini sizes too. =o)<br/> <br/>Overall this is a really nice image.  Nicely done.<br/> <br/>Anna</td>', '*Critique Club* Very nice take on the challenge, I like the several different contrasts of ideas going here.  Your focus seems good, the dof works here you might have been hurt though by the shadow created by your diagonally placed oreo, makes the oreos in the stack slightly shadowed. Only thing you are missing here is the contrast of big and small...in cause you have no little kids around yes oreos now come in mini sizes too. =o) Overall this is a really nice image.  Nicely done. Anna', '2003-08-01 19:01:37.000000', NULL, 0),
