(390666, 29584, 8367, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments and votes.<br/>I was "ify" on submitting this one. I saw all kinds of contrasts: fuzzy brown to silky, black to white, brown to white, gravel to hay, wood fence to wire fence and sunshine to shade. I didn''t think it would score well because of the bright sun and I probably made it worse by post processing. Sometimes, you need to leave well enough alone.</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments and votes.I was "ify" on submitting this one. I saw all kinds of contrasts: fuzzy brown to silky, black to white, brown to white, gravel to hay, wood fence to wire fence and sunshine to shade. I didn''t think it would score well because of the bright sun and I probably made it worse by post processing. Sometimes, you need to leave well enough alone.', '2003-08-17 19:02:56.000000', NULL, 0),
