(826352, 29581, 10263, '<td valign="top">July 26 2004 - one year and one week later<br/> <br/>I can''t believe how bad this photo is. I just got my first digital camera and was as green as they come. I actually thought this was a wonderful photo at the time! Not only is it terrible, but I didn''t even get the type of flower right. Those who commented were very kind and taught me the first of many many valuable lessons I have learned here.. and am still learning here.</td>', 'July 26 2004 - one year and one week later I can''t believe how bad this photo is. I just got my first digital camera and was as green as they come. I actually thought this was a wonderful photo at the time! Not only is it terrible, but I didn''t even get the type of flower right. Those who commented were very kind and taught me the first of many many valuable lessons I have learned here.. and am still learning here.', '2004-07-26 16:38:05.000000', NULL, 0),
